# Git workflow (canonical `main`)

The explore / demand product shipped to **`origin/main`** (promoted from `experiment-ui`, Oct 2026). One GitHub repo: **`https://github.com/uaetrail/main`**.

## Policy

- **Default branch:** `main` — pull before new work (`git pull origin main`).
- **Features:** branch off `main`, merge back via PR or explicit merge; push `origin main` when the user asks.
- **`purchasync`:** mirror to `rajpurchasync/UAEtrail` **only** when the user explicitly asks (`git-remotes.mdc`). No auto-sync after ordinary pushes to `origin`.
- **`experiment-ui`:** retired; do not treat as the active line unless the user revives it.

## Legacy snapshot

Pre-promotion `main` is frozen on **`rajpurchasync/UAEtrail`** branch `main` (not updated unless the user requests a mirror push).
